{"id":"leccio_n","lemma":"lección","pos":"noun","rank":1483,"glosses":["lesson (a section of learning or teaching)","lesson (something to learn or be learned)","lesson (something that serves as a warning or encouragement)"],"ipa":"/leɡˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lecciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-lecci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es nuestra primera lección.","en":"It's our first lesson.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741017","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"first gear"},null]},{"text":"¿Es la última lección?","en":"Is it the last lesson?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77764","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"final","l":"último"},null]},{"text":"Recuerda bien esta lección.","en":"Keep this lesson in mind.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598087","words":[{"g":"to remember","l":"recordar"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Él no disfrutó de sus lecciones.","en":"He did not enjoy his lessons.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to enjoy","l":"disfrutar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"¿No has aprendido tu lección?","en":"Haven't you learned your lesson?","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to learn","l":"aprender"},{"g":"your"},null]}]}